<title>USA: TABLE - Callon Petroleum Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Callon Petroleum Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NATCHEZ, Miss. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				 Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					   June 30	    June 30</p>
<p>					1997	1996    1997     1996</p>
<p> Revenues			$ 8,758   $ 6,047 $21,539  $12,527</p>
<p> Net income			1,209	 871   4,891    2,242</p>
<p> Preferred stock dividends     699	 699   1,398    1,398</p>
<p>Net income available to</p>
<p>  common shares		    510	 172   3,493	844</p>
<p>Net income per common share:</p>
<p>  Primary			   0.08	0.03    0.55     0.15</p>
<p>  Assuming full dilution	0.08	0.03    0.52     0.15</p>
<p>Weighted average shares:</p>
<p>  Primary			  6,268     5,755   6,307    5,755</p>
<p>  Assuming full dilution     6,331     5,755   9,318    5,755</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said higher production from its Shallow Miocene drilling program led to record earnings and revenue in the current quarter.</p>
<p>Full name is Callon Petroleum Co.</p>
</text>
